1
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,509
♪The world keeps changing♪

2
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,979
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

3
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,159
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

4
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,399
♪We stand above the world♪

5
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,590
♪Our identities switch♪

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,320
♪The world turns upside down♪

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,729
♪Watch me♪

8
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:35,319
♪Stir up a storm♪

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,609
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,059
♪Our blood is boiling♪

11
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:45,289
♪The genius emperor plots
with brilliant strategy♪

12
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:49,709
♪The slacker general
is unmatched in battle♪

13
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,199
♪The business world is in turmoil♪

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,749
♪The court is rife with intrigue♪

15
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:59,169
♪We will conquer the world♪

16
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:03,510
♪There's no escape for the traitors♪

17
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,999
=No Way! My Bro Is the Emperor=

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,119
=Episode 22=

19
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:13,680
(The Best Pavilion in the World)

20
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:21,530
Hey,

21
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:23,570
this is so boring.

22
00:01:23,590 --> 00:01:25,179
I'm about to fall asleep.

23
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:25,889
How about

24
00:01:25,890 --> 00:01:27,129
a little match?

25
00:01:27,130 --> 00:01:28,030
Sure.

26
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:32,210
Xiaoyao Pavilion.

27
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,620
Night show, get ready.

28
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:42,329
(The Best Pavilion in the World)

29
00:01:42,330 --> 00:01:44,340
Music.

30
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:47,860
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

31
00:01:50,350 --> 00:01:53,230
♪Let's create♪

32
00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:57,959
♪A legend♪

33
00:01:57,960 --> 00:02:02,850
♪Of our own♪

34
00:02:15,490 --> 00:02:16,900
Protect His Majesty!

35
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:23,369
Quick!

36
00:02:23,370 --> 00:02:24,200
Protect His Majesty!

37
00:02:29,490 --> 00:02:31,580
I'll kill you!

38
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,900
I'll go after the Princess Royal.

39
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:42,580
Gu Bei!

40
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:45,369
Gu Bei.

41
00:02:45,370 --> 00:02:46,489
- Your Majesty.
- Gu Bei!

42
00:02:46,490 --> 00:02:46,769
Gu Bei.

43
00:02:46,770 --> 00:02:48,299
Summon the imperial physician!

44
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:48,859
Gu Bei.

45
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:49,419
Gu Bei.

46
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:49,809
Wake up.

47
00:02:49,810 --> 00:02:50,879
- Summon the imperial physician!
- Gu Bei!

48
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,200
(Xiaoyao Pavilion)

49
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:57,019
Your Majesty,

50
00:02:57,020 --> 00:02:58,259
Official Gu's poison

51
00:02:58,260 --> 00:02:59,410
is extremely deadly.

52
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:01,060
If we can't find the antidote...

53
00:03:01,810 --> 00:03:03,080
What if there's no antidote?

54
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:05,799
I have an antidote from the plains.

55
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,139
This...

56
00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:07,740
It should cure him.

57
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:32,370
- Gu Bei.
- Gu Bei.

58
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:34,369
Gu Bei.

59
00:03:34,370 --> 00:03:35,240
Help him sit up.

60
00:03:37,530 --> 00:03:39,220
Imperial physician, take another look.

61
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:45,680
How is he?

62
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:48,309
His pulse has stabilized.

63
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:50,049
The medicine neutralized
most of the poison,

64
00:03:50,050 --> 00:03:51,139
but what's left

65
00:03:51,140 --> 00:03:52,459
has seeped deep into his body.

66
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:54,049
If it isn't purged soon,

67
00:03:54,050 --> 00:03:55,500
Official Gu's life

68
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:57,410
will be in danger.

69
00:04:02,610 --> 00:04:03,640
Your Majesty,

70
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:05,180
please save my brother.

71
00:04:07,650 --> 00:04:09,620
The Princess Royal
must have the antidote.

72
00:04:09,740 --> 00:04:10,810
No matter where she is,

73
00:04:10,930 --> 00:04:12,500
I'll find her.

74
00:04:12,650 --> 00:04:13,410
Wait.

75
00:04:16,060 --> 00:04:16,820
Imperial physician,

76
00:04:17,380 --> 00:04:18,650
didn't you just say

77
00:04:19,330 --> 00:04:20,990
that if the poison

78
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:22,700
can be expelled,

79
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,140
he'll survive?

80
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:26,070
That's right.

81
00:04:31,410 --> 00:04:32,170
No.

82
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:33,259
I've had enough.

83
00:04:33,260 --> 00:04:34,050
I'm leaving.

84
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:36,619
Your cold isn't getting better.

85
00:04:36,620 --> 00:04:37,139
A good steam

86
00:04:37,140 --> 00:04:38,560
will help sweat the toxins out.

87
00:04:40,060 --> 00:04:41,290
I have an idea.

88
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:45,700
It's worth a try.

89
00:04:49,090 --> 00:04:50,210
Gu Bei,

90
00:04:50,730 --> 00:04:52,460
a man only dies once.

91
00:04:53,020 --> 00:04:54,700
You've already died once.

92
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,440
You don't get another chance.

93
00:04:57,140 --> 00:04:58,290
Wake up now.

94
00:04:58,500 --> 00:04:59,340
Do you hear me?

95
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:26,529
Gu...

96
00:05:26,530 --> 00:05:27,260
Gu Bei.

97
00:05:30,090 --> 00:05:30,820
Gu Bei?

98
00:05:33,850 --> 00:05:35,340
Are you awake?

99
00:05:35,850 --> 00:05:37,310
If you don't wake up,

100
00:05:38,850 --> 00:05:39,939
I'll sell

101
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:41,000
Xiaoyao Pavilion.

102
00:05:41,820 --> 00:05:42,820
I'm serious.

103
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:45,490
You can take my life,

104
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:50,940
but don't you dare sell Xiaoyao Pavilion.

105
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:10,170
Whatever it takes,

106
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,680
you must deliver the message.

107
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,800
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

108
00:06:21,650 --> 00:06:22,380
Bei,

109
00:06:22,850 --> 00:06:24,460
how do you feel right now?

110
00:06:24,530 --> 00:06:25,649
I feel completely refreshed

111
00:06:25,650 --> 00:06:27,410
after that sleep.

112
00:06:27,650 --> 00:06:28,570
Xiao,

113
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:29,649
you saved my life.

114
00:06:29,650 --> 00:06:32,020
No, your Xiaoyao Pavilion did.

115
00:06:32,770 --> 00:06:33,899
I told you.

116
00:06:33,900 --> 00:06:35,460
A good steam flushes out the poison.

117
00:06:37,650 --> 00:06:39,020
Have you found the Princess Royal?

118
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:41,900
We've searched the whole city.

119
00:06:41,970 --> 00:06:43,260
She's nowhere to be found.

120
00:06:43,330 --> 00:06:44,380
She has joined forces

121
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:45,900
with Western Yi.

122
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,780
Their fifty thousand troops

123
00:06:47,820 --> 00:06:49,020
are already outside the capital.

124
00:06:49,090 --> 00:06:50,340
I've sent my shadow guards

125
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:52,209
to deliver my orders to every commander,

126
00:06:52,210 --> 00:06:53,240
calling them to the capital

127
00:06:53,730 --> 00:06:54,820
to capture the usurper.

128
00:06:55,900 --> 00:06:57,380
Then we'll hold the city

129
00:06:57,770 --> 00:06:58,920
until reinforcements arrive.

130
00:06:59,590 --> 00:07:00,900
It won't be that easy.

131
00:07:05,210 --> 00:07:06,610
The nearest army

132
00:07:06,650 --> 00:07:07,850
is over 500 li away.

133
00:07:08,140 --> 00:07:09,499
Even if they ride day and night,

134
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:10,970
it'll take at least seven days.

135
00:07:11,170 --> 00:07:12,089
If

136
00:07:12,090 --> 00:07:13,490
the Western Yi attacks,

137
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:14,940
we can hold out

138
00:07:15,410 --> 00:07:16,940
for only three days.

139
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:24,780
Xiao,

140
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,170
I've got an idea.

141
00:07:28,060 --> 00:07:28,780
What's it?

142
00:07:29,090 --> 00:07:30,459
Let's run.

143
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:31,729
A wise man knows when to retreat.

144
00:07:31,730 --> 00:07:32,729
Staying alive comes first.

145
00:07:32,730 --> 00:07:34,380
Besides, we're rich now.

146
00:07:34,410 --> 00:07:35,459
We can just pick a place

147
00:07:35,460 --> 00:07:37,530
and start over, can't?

148
00:07:39,060 --> 00:07:39,970
Run?

149
00:07:40,650 --> 00:07:41,529
Where would I go?

150
00:07:41,530 --> 00:07:42,610
Come with me to the frontier.

151
00:07:42,650 --> 00:07:44,409
Or back to the plains.

152
00:07:44,410 --> 00:07:45,209
We can take

153
00:07:45,210 --> 00:07:46,649
Gu Nan and Xiao Ling.

154
00:07:46,650 --> 00:07:47,580
If you want,

155
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:48,499
you can bring

156
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:50,729
all your consorts too.

157
00:07:50,730 --> 00:07:51,730
What about them?

158
00:07:52,210 --> 00:07:53,380
Who?

159
00:07:55,380 --> 00:07:56,860
The people of Jing.

160
00:07:58,700 --> 00:07:59,850
What will they do?

161
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:03,000
The Princess Royal sold Fushou Cream
to poison her own people

162
00:08:03,410 --> 00:08:05,730
for the throne.

163
00:08:06,580 --> 00:08:08,050
If she becomes emperor,

164
00:08:09,090 --> 00:08:10,700
what will become of the realm?

165
00:08:16,210 --> 00:08:17,530
And what can you do by staying?

166
00:08:20,803 --> 00:08:21,899
Can you hold the capital?

167
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:22,649
Bei,

168
00:08:22,650 --> 00:08:23,820
if I'm not wrong,

169
00:08:24,060 --> 00:08:25,899
you hated history class,

170
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:26,650
didn't you?

171
00:08:26,820 --> 00:08:28,529
What are you trying to get at?

172
00:08:28,530 --> 00:08:29,819
You think history can save you?

173
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:30,580
No.

174
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:32,289
But it taught me

175
00:08:32,290 --> 00:08:34,420
what it means to be a ruler.

176
00:08:34,810 --> 00:08:36,180
"The emperor guards the frontier,

177
00:08:36,770 --> 00:08:37,970
a king dies with his nation."

178
00:08:38,500 --> 00:08:40,130
Even if I don't belong to this era,

179
00:08:40,740 --> 00:08:42,610
I still have a duty to fulfill.

180
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:48,700
I hate violence.

181
00:08:50,450 --> 00:08:51,540
But now

182
00:08:51,980 --> 00:08:53,010
I have no choice.

183
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:57,540
Because I'm the Emperor.

184
00:09:02,530 --> 00:09:03,639
Alright.

185
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,130
My good Emperor.

186
00:09:07,165 --> 00:09:09,049
Then we'll die together.

187
00:09:09,050 --> 00:09:10,250
Maybe if we both die,

188
00:09:10,410 --> 00:09:12,259
we'll wake up back in modern times.

189
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:13,420
If you're staying,

190
00:09:13,900 --> 00:09:15,530
I'm staying too.

191
00:09:17,620 --> 00:09:18,520
No.

192
00:09:18,810 --> 00:09:19,980
You have to leave.

193
00:09:21,650 --> 00:09:23,540
I'm entrusting
those dear to me to your care.

194
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:29,279
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

195
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:31,679
♪Our spirit soars to the skies♪

196
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:37,119
♪The brainy emperor plots the strategy♪

197
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:41,479
♪The slacker general leads the charge♪

198
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:43,879
♪Swords clash and warhorses thunder♪

199
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:46,439
♪Let the history judge our deeds♪

200
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:52,041
♪Our brotherhood is priceless♪

201
00:09:52,042 --> 00:09:57,602
♪Peace across the land, carefree at last♪

202
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:04,000
♪Funny moments never stop♪

203
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,840
♪Silly blunders never cease♪

204
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:11,199
♪Yet through every up and down♪

205
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,160
♪We create miracles♪

206
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,920
♪From naive youths♪

207
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,679
♪To legendary heroes♪

208
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:20,599
♪This journey♪

209
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:24,639
♪Is one we'll be proud of♪

210
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:27,160
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

211
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:32,520
♪Let's create♪

212
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:42,240
♪A legend of our own♪
